MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Bon_m01_001: From Your Majesty's heir to the question of\nPrince Dyan...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Bon_m01_002: There are a number of unresolved issues on my\nplate. Or rather, Saramis's plate.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Bon_m01_003: For now, we must focus our attention on winning\nthe Heroic Games.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c07_Bon_m01: <BLN>These issues continue to mount...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Tob_m01_001: Don't you worry, boss. If luck's all we need, I'm a\nfairly lucky guy. 
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Tob_m01_002: Take yesterday. There was this guy I was drinking\nwith at the bar, and I ended up walking him home.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Tob_m01_003: And as thanks, he gave me a whole cask of cervi.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Tob_m01_004: It's gone now, though. Downed the whole thing this\nmorning. Gwahahaha!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c07_Tob_m01: <BLN>We're too lucky to lose.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lil_m01_001: That girl we're up against next, Alexandra, is\napparently a wing soldier.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lil_m01_002: So it sounds to me like you'll be needing my bow\neven more than usual.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lil_m01_003: All in a day's work, of course. Thanks in advance for\nthe bonus pay, Your Majesty.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c07_Lil_m01: <BLN>No sweat, right?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_001: About this Alexandra woman we'll soon be facing...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_002: I asked around about her reputation, and she seems\nto be quite popular.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_003: <NCA>Ask for details.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_004: <NCB>Dismiss his concern.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_005: <ACA>Admittedly, not everyone's opinion is so rosy. Some\nseemed envious of her. But that's natural.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_006: <ACA>What's less natural to me is that she's made it this\nfar in the games solely through forfeits.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_007: <ACB>She's a knight in the service of Jurah's temple, so she\nmay have a powerful backer.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01_008: <ACB>Personally, I think we should be ready for anything.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c07_Lys_m01: <BLN>We must be on our guard.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B01_m01_001: I really don't care for that Alexandra.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B01_m01_002: Oh, she acts like she wouldn't hurt a fly, but who\nknows what's behind the facade?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c07_B01_m01: <BLN>Something's fishy about her.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B02_m01_001: Alexandra is adorable! She's from a noble family,\nshe's well-mannered, and her looks are to die for.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B02_m01_002: It'll never happen outside my dreams, but I'd love to\ngo on a date with her.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c07_B02_m01_003: I'd even settle for being her pegasus.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c07_B02_m01: <BLN>She's the cutest...